      "content": "It's a good idea to take your symptoms seriously, even if they feel minor, because those skin reactions could be a sign of an allergic reaction. Instead of powering through with high caffeine, I strongly advise you to take a few minutes to monitor your symptoms closely. If the itching worsens, you start having trouble breathing, or you feel dizzy, you need to stop exercising immediately and seek medical attention.",
