      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like ur being a bit too cautious lol. i literally just feel a bit restless, which i usually get from the pre-workout anyway. if i take the caffeine, it might actually help me focus on the sensation and realize it's nothing. plus, if i just sit here, i'm gonna get more anxious and that'll make the itching feel worse. can't i just dose it slightly lower or just take it and see how my heart rate feels? i feel fine otherwise.",
